    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、じゃあしっかり踊り切れるくらいになるよなぁ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "おかげで今日役に立てたから、\r\n全部オッケー！　ってことで！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030170"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ええー！　それは褒めすぎだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "目的は演出確認！　って唱えながらやってたよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "せめてフォーメーションチェンジだけは……！\r\nって思ってたから、そっちばっかりになっちゃって",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もうもう、他は全然ダメだった！\r\n気持ちとか表現とか、色々！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やっぱりちょっと練習したくらいじゃ\r\n動画みたいに踊るのは難しいなって",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……ものすごく綺麗に揃ってたもんなぁ、動画",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ね！　息の合い方がね、やっぱり\r\nずっと一緒にやってるからこそって感じで",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でもね、ちょっと新鮮……というか\r\n不思議な感覚？　だったなぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "いつもは真乃と灯織が隣にいるから\r\nついアイコンタクトしようとして、あれっ！？　って",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは、あれそういうことだったのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えーっ！　ばれてた！？\r\n恥ずかしいなぁ！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "なんかね、早くイルミネのリハやりたいなーってなった！\r\nえへへっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030270"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "スタッフさんたちも感心しきりだった\r\n『元からわかってて練習してきたんじゃないか』って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あははっ",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "さすがにエスパーじゃないよー！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でもでも、そうやって褒めてもらえるの嬉しいなぁ\r\n役に立てたってことだもんね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301403/2003014030300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、そうだな\r\nみんな助かってた",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるのおかげだ\r\nありがとうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003014030310,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "なんかそんなに言われると照れちゃうけど……！",
